{"insertText":{"location":{"index":144719,"tabId":"t.l5c18frq5wuo"},"text":"\nWithin datasets, the BO-selected configuration had the highest point estimates of any model evaluated on FF++ C40 (0.9941) and Celeb-DF v2 (0.9983), but none of its eight differences from the encoders was significant, so these leads are descriptive. Under transfer, it was significantly better than Swin-B in six of the nine directions and, from FF++ C23 to C40, significantly better than both encoders (+0.0123 and +0.0116). It was significantly worse than Video Swin-B from FF++ C23 to DeeperForensics-1.0 (−0.1105) and from Celeb-DF v2 to FF++ C23 (−0.0390)."}},
