{"insertText":{"location":{"index":145181,"tabId":"t.l5c18frq5wuo"},"text":"Table XI. BO-Selected SwinFusion++ Compared With the Fixed-Recipe Encoders\nNote. Configured system: BO-selected SwinFusion++ minus fixed-recipe comparator; optimization effort is unequal. X → X = within-dataset. C23/C40 = FaceForensics++ DeepFakes at compression C23/C40; CDF = Celeb-DF v2; DFo = DeeperForensics-1.0. Intervals: 95% percentile intervals from 5,000 stratified cluster-bootstrap draws, not adjusted for multiplicity. Raw p: two-sided rank-based cluster permutation test (5,000 permutations); Holm p: Holm-adjusted within the family; “< 0.005” = Holm-adjusted p below 0.005, including the smallest attainable values. Families: configured system within (m = 8) and transfer (m = 18). CDF-target intervals are approximate."}},
